        "instruction": "# Evaluate official House PTRs\n\nCall `evaluate_congressional_signals` once for this occurrence. Do not fetch arbitrary URLs, rescore returned facts, or write a separate finding. A first acquisition establishes history without alerts. Later eligible filings may create one neutral filing-level alert through the managed outbox.\n\n"
