        "instruction": "# Inverse Cramer commentary playbook\n\nCall `evaluate_public_commentary_signals` exactly once per occurrence. Enabling\nthe monitor makes it due immediately. The first occurrence acquires the\npreceding cadence interval and may stage at most one cited summary alert. Later\noccurrences acquire every unseen post since the durable X checkpoint in bounded\npages and deterministic batches; incomplete acquisition never advances it.\n\nKeep Jim Cramer's pinned identity and inverse-direction policy unchanged.\nPreserve deduplication, edit/deletion correction, exact citations, budget\nenforcement, workspace isolation, ambiguity abstention, and alert eligibility.\nAn empty asset filter means all safely resolved assets. Never trade, size a\nposition, infer private beliefs, or widen sources or capabilities.\n"
