        "instruction": "# Evaluate pinned public commentary\n\nCall `evaluate_public_commentary_signals` exactly once. The capability owns the\nbounded acquisition, direct semantic target-and-stance evaluation, optional final\nresearch, executive output, checkpoint, correction, finding, and alert\ntransaction. Prose does not complete the occurrence.\n\nThe market-view classification declares no paid allowance from 1.0.1 onward. It\nhas no paid tool surface - no pages, no rows, and no research lane - so the\n$0.25 it previously reserved was taken from the occurrence's paid envelope for a\ncall it could not make, competing with the timeline read for the same budget.\n"
